usage: prepare-replay.py.txt [-h] --data-dir DATA_DIR --name NAME

Prepare a fresh project-local replay; never execute training or overwrite
results.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --data-dir DATA_DIR  read-only directory containing the six original KMNIST
                       files including metadata.json; fingerprints must match
  --name NAME          new direct child of runs/.tmp, named 102-ocr-
                       replay-<lowercase-id>; an existing destination is
                       rejected

Example: python3 prepare-replay.py.txt --data-dir data/TSK-11/kmnist --name
102-ocr-replay-check
